{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:6da13b5f3098def158d2c6f846663beb88096869269fdfc964253716015e66c6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65951c116452d8c6737ee27c76a4eb64a6afd5a75b06715a48f95abb014548f6",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n我们这边刚到男道拉面店哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ae027b1f8182406e159460068610501007a6b8ec484ac12c4139bd716db4218",
      "text": "你知道大概还要多久能过来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9efd2ffb9596fe18500f1551486c533f0046435c7cd85a6dc14839187802fdd",
      "text": "我现在就出发，\n查一下之后联系您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1aa58ed5c7ed13f42b17351414f4e0ff6444abe318797df7fd33a520b8f82e73",
      "text": "差不多马上就能\n离开事务所了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cfb586122cd5d4c4eccc5fe64795c2b7aa96b9c0b65cc9bf0f0bee97f3da973",
      "text": "这样啊。忙到这么晚辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea01191071eb9518d2032b82c237259bd3242c8b22a444b0b8dc8eb558a509c",
      "text": "不用着急，路上小心过来哦。\n大家也都说不用在意时间的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcada0870c515d73ce47eb8101cd59218eac97ef9024b3cf1e5f5b4a8ca51d0b",
      "text": "等碰头了之后，我们再慢慢聊聊\n今天碰头会上的事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e68f4bffa53c32e42081907f5cf7028547d1b88d0e40573a9090acbe0d636b5c",
      "text": "我有好多事情想跟你说呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5f11b3cf69db93a1eb976cad4d25db3f9072111c8f8e4af6bab4a7a3e6376a3",
      "text": "这也证明今天的讨论很有成效呀。\n话题一直聊个没完呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a70de912066cf740029183048fd834fc42802a50983707f31eac41c810f515d",
      "text": "比如……哎呀，要是现在聊起来怕是停不下来了，\n还是先打住吧。敬请期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:018shm_403_2_4_018_03_09_c:2_4_018_03_09_c:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73b38a21a1cd71470beac646c21edb8bd089ad37ccbf0b92b9eade406bae2f32",
      "text": "那我先挂断啦。\n有什么事随时再联系我。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
